# ComicCraft-AI-Story-Creator
AI comic story creator using Gemini models - SmartBridge Project⁠.
Phase 1: Brainstorming & Ideation Phase - ComicCraft
1. Project Overview
 Project Title: ComicCraft - AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
 Domain: Artificial Intelligence / Generative AI / Creative Content Tools
 Core Concept: An application that leverages Google's advanced Gemini generative AI models to automatically generate comic book scripts, character dialogues, plot outlines, and panel descriptions from simple user text prompts.
2. Problem Statement
 Creating comic books requires extensive time, artistic capability, storytelling skills, and creative writing effort.
 Writers and creators often experience "writer's block" or face difficulties structuring multi-panel comic book layouts, dialogue pacing, and scene descriptions.
 There is a need for an automated, AI-powered assistant that can quickly brainstorm plots, draft comic scripts, and structure panels seamlessly.
3. Proposed Solution
 Develop ComicCraft, an AI-powered web or desktop tool utilizing the Gemini API.
 Users can input a simple genre, theme, or concept (e.g., "A sci-fi adventure about a time-traveling cat").
 The application processes the prompt using Gemini models to output structured comic book elements:
 Title & Logline
 Character Profiles
 Page-by-Page & Panel-by-Panel Descriptions
 Dialogue Bubbles and Narration Boxes
4. Target Audience & Use Cases
 Indie Comic Creators & Writers: To rapidly prototype storylines and script panels.
 Hobbyists & Content Creators: People who want to create engaging visual stories without deep scriptwriting experience.
 Educators & Students: For creative writing exercises and storytelling visualization.
5. Feasibility & Technology Stack
 AI Engine: Google Gemini API (for high-context natural language generation and structured data creation).
 Programming Language: Python / JavaScript
 Frontend/Backend Framework: Streamlit, Flask, or React (depending on your implementation choice).
